<title>BRAZIL: Brazil 1997/98 soybean harvest forecasts - Safras.</title>
<headline>Brazil 1997/98 soybean harvest forecasts - Safras.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil 1997/98 soybean planting intentions and forecast crop state by state, according to independent consultant Safras e Mercado.</p>
<p>Planted area in thousands of hectares and production in thousands of tonnes.</p>
<p>			  1997/98     1997/98     1996/97    1996/97</p>
<p>			Planted    Production   Planted   Production</p>
<p>			   area			  area</p>
<p>Rio Grande do Sul   3,070	 6,140	 2,950	4,800</p>
<p>Parana		  2,760	 7,314	 2,646	6,600</p>
<p>Mato Grosso	   2,270	 5,902	 2,070	5,400</p>
<p>Goias		   1,090	 2,616	   980	2,352</p>
<p>Mato Grosso do Sul    950	 2,280	   887	2,160</p>
<p>Sao Paulo		 630	 1,512	   580	1,450</p>
<p>Minas Gerais	    600	 1,440	   540	1,296</p>
<p>Bahia		     490	 1,083	   460	1,000</p>
<p>Santa Catarina	  244	   561	   235	  660</p>
<p>Maranhao		  150	   300	   130	  270</p>
<p>Distrito Federal	 40	    88	    34	   75</p>
<p>Piaui			22	    53	    17	   42</p>
<p>Tocantins		  20	    40	    15	   20</p>
<p>Rondonia		   10	    24	     5	   12</p>
<p>TOTAL		  12,346	29,333	11,449     26,027</p>
<p>((--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo +55 11 248 5417))</p>
</text>
